title: Authorizations › New Case › Save as draft and leave
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId, then /authorizations?view=progress
intro: A case becomes a draft, listed in Authorizations as an In progress row, once it is saved, which happens on 'Save as draft' and also on 'Start the agents'. Leaving without saving leaves nothing in Authorizations. The draft keeps which of the five steps it was on, so opening it puts the person back where the case was. The step is part of the draft, so 'Send to payer' and a draft row's button in Authorizations land on the right one.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Working on a new case"
start s2 "On a case page, click 'Open in review and sign' or 'Send to payer'"
process pReq "A draft is made from the request, or the one it already has is brought up to date\nIt opens on Review & submit when the request is ready, on Authorization preparation when agents still have work\nIt is not saved"
goto gCase "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Send to payer and review and sign"

group gSave "Ways a draft gets saved"
  click c1 "Click 'Save as draft' on Intake, Eligibility & Benefits or Clinical documentation"
  click c2 "Click 'Save as draft' on Review & submit"
  click c3 "Click 'Start the agents'\nNo toast is shown"
  process pNo3 "Authorization preparation has no 'Save as draft' button\nThe run itself saved the case"
endgroup

store stId "A case id may already exist\nThe first check on Eligibility & Benefits and a first save both assign it\nIt falls at the case's site"
decision dAlready "Is the case already saved?"
store st1 "Draft marked saved and given a case ID\nR- for Residential 3.5 and Detox, I- for IOP, P- for PHP\nA draft with no level of care yet falls under R\nNumbered from 1701"
process pNoop "Nothing changes; the toast still shows"
toast t1 "Steps 1 to 3: 'Draft saved'\n'R-1701 is in Authorizations.'"
toast t2 "Review & submit: 'Draft saved'\n'R-1701 is in Authorizations.'"
store stPos "The draft keeps its step\nIntake, Eligibility & Benefits, Clinical documentation, Authorization preparation or Review & submit\nAnd what was typed, picked, answered and documented"

click cLeave "Click 'Authorizations' at the top, a sidebar item, or close the tab"
decision dSaved "Was the case saved?"
process pUnsaved "Nothing appears in Authorizations\nThe draft stays in this session and its address still opens it\nOpening New Case again starts another blank draft"
process pAway "A running case stops moving while the page is closed\nThe row shows the agent that was working\nOr, when an agent could not finish: 'Verify could not reach Cardinal's portal. Retry it or skip it'"

screen sCM "Authorizations › In progress (also in All)\nA draft of a listed request stays on that request's row; a new case is a row of its own\nOnly cases at the sites in view"
screen sRow "A row for the draft\nCase ID and patient, status chip, the agent line as next action, due pill, owner, approval chance, one button"
decision dState "What state is the draft in?"
process rIntake "'Intake not finished'\nButton 'Continue'; chance shows 'None'"
process rWork "'Agents working'\nButton 'Watch'"
process rAsk "'Needs your input'\nButton 'Answer'"
process rReady "'Ready to sign'\nButton 'Review and sign'"
process pBadge "'Needs attention' counts drafts that need a person\nIntake not finished, a question, or ready to sign"
process pDash "The Dashboard counts a saved draft under 'Preparing'\nA draft that was never saved is not counted\nSeeded cases such as R-1042 are counted as requests"
click cOpen "Click the case ID, or the row's button"
process pResume "Opens /authorizations/new/DRAFT\nThe page resumes where the draft was\nA draft whose agents already ran opens on Authorization preparation or Review & submit, never on Intake"
goto gResume "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Finished, paused or left"
goto gStep3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue"
goto gOpen "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Reopen and resume a case"
goto gCM "Continues in: Authorizations › In progress › Drafts being prepared"

screen sNF "New Case\n'That draft is not in the demo.'\n'We could not find that draft'\n'It may have been cleared when the demo data was reset.'"
click cNew "Click 'Start a new case'"
process pNew "A new blank draft opens on Intake"
goto gRef "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient"

s2 --> pReq --> gCase
s1 --> c1
s1 --> c2
s1 --> c3
s1 --> pNo3
s1 -.-> stId
c1 --> dAlready
c2 --> dAlready
c3 --> dAlready
dAlready -->|No| st1 --> stPos
dAlready -->|Yes| pNoop
c1 --> t1
c2 --> t2
stPos --> sCM

s1 --> cLeave --> dSaved
dSaved -->|No| pUnsaved
dSaved -->|Yes| sCM
dSaved -->|Yes, running| pAway --> sCM
pUnsaved -.-> sNF

sCM --> sRow --> dState
dState -->|Intake not finished| rIntake
dState -->|Agents working| rWork
dState -->|Question open| rAsk
dState -->|Signature needed| rReady
sCM --> pBadge
sCM --> pDash
sCM -.-> gCM
rIntake --> cOpen
rWork --> cOpen
rAsk --> cOpen
rReady --> cOpen
cOpen --> pResume
pResume --> gResume
pResume --> gStep3
pResume -.-> gOpen

sNF --> cNew --> pNew --> gRef
